# The Sensational She-Hulk (cast on turn 1 as in the declined-retaliation scenario) and an Ornithopter double-block Bot2's Sunset
# Saboteur (menace) on turn 6; the Saboteur deals 2 to each at the same moment. That is one trigger for each creature dealt damage,
# two in all. Bot1 aims both at Bot2 and the first, accepted, deals 2; the second finds "do this only once each turn" already done
# and does nothing, so Bot2 loses just 2 (and no question is asked for the second).

